This patch fixes bug W342-4, "Some machines with some versions of Windows
seem to run NetHack very slowly." You only need it if you play the Windows
tty (non-graphical) port of NetHack, and only if it runs slowly on your
computer. Thanks to Michael Allison for helping me debug my initial
attempt.

For a week or two, there will be a binary available for download at
http://post.queensu.ca/~lehotay/nh342wintty.zip

